-- הסכם קיבוצי מיוחד מיום 31.3.2020: the special agreement between the State
-- and הסתדרות המורים for the teaching employees of the teacher-training
-- colleges in the first corona lockdown, registered on 15.6.2020 (no.
-- 109/2020). Whom it covers — a college teacher in the State's service, or
-- at a college that signed the accession letter of its annex א', for his
-- position at the college (§10); its period, from the order restricting
-- activity (15.3.2020) to the start of the academic year תשפ"א (§11); the
-- semester B duties go on (§12), and what cannot be done is done by that
-- start (§13); the salary is unchanged (§14), with nothing paid for the
-- deferred duties (§15); a duty prevented is reported (§16) and a duty not
-- done reduces the consideration (§17); the follow-up committee (§§18–22);
-- exhaustion and industrial peace (§§25–28); and it is "another agreement"
-- under the emergency regulations that extended the leave agreement of
-- 18.3.2020 to the wider public sector (§32).
--
-- The circular תש"פ/6 (l4/circulars/2019-20_tashaf_06.l4) carries this
-- agreement to the owning bodies, with the appeal its own letter adds; it
-- re-encodes the agreement's rules, from before this file existed, and
-- does not yet import it. It speaks to no pay item of l4/lib/vocabulary.l4
-- and is in no root.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary

-- not weighed against `the Annual Leave Law`: §13 has the academic duties
-- not done in semester B completed by the start of תשפ"א "notwithstanding
-- any arrangement" on the lecturers' vacation dates, as the institution
-- directs; how many days, if any, they take from a lecturer's leave turns
-- on what is left undone and on each institution's directions, and the
-- colleges' vacation arrangement is outside the corpus, so nothing here
-- sets a day of leave the law could be weighed against.

-- not weighed against `the Advance Notice Law`: §17 names the end of the
-- work relation with the institution only as when a reduction may be
-- deducted from the final settlement; it gives or asks no notice.

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: §2 says the agreement speaks of
-- men and women alike, either gender meaning the other; nothing gives pay
-- or other remuneration by sex.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי מיוחד מיום 31.3.2020 — עובדי הוראה במכללות להכשרת עובדי הוראה בתקופת חירום`

-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 The parties: the State, by the wages commissioner and the director-general ("the employers"), and הסתדרות המורים, by its secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The Registrar's stamp: registered on 15.6.2020, number 109/2020; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 Recitals: fighting the corona virus needed special instructions restricting workplaces and work, so ordinary work is impossible.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: the isolation order of 12.3.2020 forbade frontal teaching and group exams at the colleges, and the order of 15.3.2020 restricting educational institutions forbade any gathering there until 18.4.2020 (outside the corpus).
-- akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15 Recitals: the contracts cannot be kept as usual in semester B of תש"ף; the parties keep public health and seek certainty of pay and the colleges' academic work.
-- akn:preamble/p16 A recital: the emergency regulations extending the leave agreement to the wider public sector stand aside for another collective agreement approved by the wages commissioner; §32 encodes it.
-- akn:preamble/p17 akn:preamble/p18 The parties set their understandings down here, and the words of agreement; no rule.
-- akn:art_1 akn:art_2 akn:art_3 akn:art_4 akn:art_5 akn:art_6 akn:art_8 Rules of interpretation (the preamble is part of it; headings, gender and number; a law, agreement or procedure as amended from time to time; naming one changes not its standing; drafts do not interpret it); no rule to compute.

-- ¶2: signed on 31.03.2020 (written in by hand).
@ref akn:preamble/p2
`the colleges' corona agreement of 31.3.2020 was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 3 2020

`the orders the colleges' corona agreement of 31.3.2020 recites` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "צו בריאות העם (נגיף הקורונה החדש) (בידוד בית והוראות שונות) (הוראת שעה), התש\"ף-2020, וצו בריאות העם (נגיף הקורונה החדש) (הגבלת פעילות מוסדות חינוך) (הוראת שעה), התש\"ף-2020"

DECLARE `action of 31.3.2020` IS ONE OF
    `change the agreement of 31.3.2020, in writing`
    `carry out the semester B academic duties, of 31.3.2020`
    `complete the deferred academic duties, of 31.3.2020`
    `report a duty prevented to the manager, of 31.3.2020`
    `reduce the consideration, of 31.3.2020`
    `convene the follow-up committee of 31.3.2020`
    `cooperate in carrying out the agreement of 31.3.2020`
    `support a claim at odds with the agreement of 31.3.2020`
    `negotiate further pay for the period of 31.3.2020`
    `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 31.3.2020 settles`

-- §7: a change is made by the parties' consent, in writing only.
@ref akn:art_7
`changing the agreement of 31.3.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MAY   `change the agreement of 31.3.2020, in writing`

§§ `9 הגדרות`

-- "מנהל": whom each institution names for this. An input.
@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9/p1
GIVEN `whom the institution named` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the manager of 31.3.2020` `whom the institution named` IS `whom the institution named`

§§ `10 תחולת ההסכם`

-- §10: the teaching employees at the teacher-training colleges, on the
-- teaching employees' scale with their salary by the teachers' agreements,
-- who are (א) in the State's service or (ב) at a college that signed the
-- accession letter of annex א'; ¶3: for their position at the college only.
@desc A college teaching employee, as far as the agreement of 31.3.2020 asks.
DECLARE `college lecturer of 31.3.2020` HAS
    `employed at a teacher-training college` IS A BOOLEAN
    `on the teaching employees' scale, with their salary` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in the State's service` IS A BOOLEAN
    `at a college that signed the accession letter` IS A BOOLEAN
    `position at the college` IS A NUMBER
    `position elsewhere` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_10/p1 akn:art_10__para_a akn:art_10__para_b akn:art_10/p2
GIVEN e IS A `college lecturer of 31.3.2020`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 31.3.2020 covers` e IF
        e's `employed at a teacher-training college`
    AND e's `on the teaching employees' scale, with their salary`
    AND (e's `in the State's service` OR e's `at a college that signed the accession letter`)

@ref akn:art_10/p3
GIVEN e IS A `college lecturer of 31.3.2020`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position the agreement of 31.3.2020 governs` e IS
    IF `the agreement of 31.3.2020 covers` e THEN e's `position at the college` ELSE 0

§§ `11 תקופת ההסכם ותוקפו`
    @ref akn:art_11/p1
    GIVEN `the start of the academic year תשפ"א at the college` IS A DATE @desc the agreement names no day

-- §11: from the order restricting activity, 15.3.2020, to the start of the
-- academic year תשפ"א ("the agreement's period"); it governs also what is
-- to be done after the period.
@ref akn:art_11/p1
`the period of 31.3.2020 begins` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 15 3 2020

@ref akn:art_11/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the period of 31.3.2020` d IF
        DATE_SERIAL d AT LEAST DATE_SERIAL `the period of 31.3.2020 begins`
    AND DATE_SERIAL d LESS THAN DATE_SERIAL `the start of the academic year תשפ"א at the college`

§§ `12–15 המשך פעילות אקדמית והתמורה`

-- §12: the lecturers go on with all the semester B duties — lessons,
-- exercises, labs, tours, exams, office hours, grading, committees,
-- teaching online, and any duty imposed in the period — as the institution
-- decides ("חובות ומטלות אקדמיות").
@ref akn:art_12/p1
`carrying out the semester B duties, of 31.3.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `carry out the semester B academic duties, of 31.3.2020`

-- §13: notwithstanding any arrangement or custom on the lecturers' vacation
-- dates, duties that could not be done in semester B are done in full by
-- the start of תשפ"א, as the institution directs ("נדחות").
@ref akn:art_13
`completing the deferred duties, of 31.3.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `complete the deferred academic duties, of 31.3.2020`

-- §14: subject to the above, the salary for the full performance of the
-- semester B duties, by the agreements that apply, does not change ("the
-- consideration"); components that depend on reporting (the travel
-- allowance among them) are not in it and keep their own rules.
@ref akn:art_14
GIVEN `salary for the full semester B duties, reporting-dependent components aside` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the consideration of 31.3.2020` `salary for the full semester B duties, reporting-dependent components aside` IS
    `salary for the full semester B duties, reporting-dependent components aside`

-- §15: nothing beyond the consideration for the deferred duties, though
-- done when no teaching would have been held, or after semester B; a
-- basic condition of paying the consideration in full.
@ref akn:art_15
GIVEN `pay claimed for the deferred duties` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay for the deferred duties, of 31.3.2020` `pay claimed for the deferred duties` IS 0

§§ `16 דיווח`

@ref akn:art_16/p1
`reporting a prevented duty, of 31.3.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `report a duty prevented to the manager, of 31.3.2020`

§§ `17 ניכוי שכר`

-- §17: a lecturer the manager finds did not meet §12 or §13 is not paid the
-- whole consideration: the institution reduces it in proportion, or
-- deducts from any sum due him, the final settlement included. The share
-- not done is the manager's finding, an input.
@ref akn:art_17/p1
GIVEN `the consideration due` IS A NUMBER
      `share of the §12 and §13 duties not done` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the consideration of 31.3.2020 after a reduction` `the consideration due` `share of the §12 and §13 duties not done` IS
    `the consideration due` TIMES (1 MINUS `share of the §12 and §13 duties not done`)

`reducing the consideration, of 31.3.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MAY   `reduce the consideration, of 31.3.2020`

§§ `18–22 ועדת מעקב`

-- §18: on 19.4.2020 a follow-up committee — the wages commissioner, the
-- director-general and the union's secretary-general — decides whether
-- the agreement goes on, is amended or ends; §19–20: at once on any change
-- in the restrictions before or after that day. §21: by telephone or
-- video too. §22: its decisions are final and bind the parties.
@ref akn:art_18/p1 akn:art_19 akn:art_20 akn:art_21 akn:art_22
`the follow-up committee of 31.3.2020 meets on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 19 4 2020

GIVEN `the restrictions changed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `action of 31.3.2020`
DECIDE `convening the follow-up committee of 31.3.2020` `the restrictions changed` IS
    IF `the restrictions changed`
    THEN PARTY `the follow-up committee`
         MUST  `convene the follow-up committee of 31.3.2020`
         WITHIN 1
    ELSE FULFILLED

`the follow-up committee's decisions of 31.3.2020 bind the parties` MEANS TRUE

§§ `23–28 שיתוף פעולה, אי תמיכה, מיצוי ושקט תעשייתי`

@ref akn:art_23/p1
`cooperating, of 31.3.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    MUST  `cooperate in carrying out the agreement of 31.3.2020`

@ref akn:art_24/p1
`not supporting claims against the agreement of 31.3.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `support a claim at odds with the agreement of 31.3.2020`

-- §25: it exhausts every claim of the parties for the period, pay and
-- terms among them, on what it settles; §26: no further negotiation on pay
-- for the period; §28: it takes nothing from the exhaustion and peace
-- clauses already binding.
@ref akn:art_25/p1 akn:art_26 akn:art_28
`negotiating further pay for the period, of 31.3.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `negotiate further pay for the period of 31.3.2020`

@ref akn:art_27
`industrial peace of 31.3.2020` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 31.3.2020 settles`

§§ `29–33 כללי`

-- §29: the understandings depend on one another, one whole. §30: subject
-- to every law, emergency regulations and orders under the Public Health
-- Ordinance among them. §31: on a conflict with an earlier agreement,
-- arrangement, procedure or custom, this agreement prevails. §33: it is
-- filed for registration as a special collective agreement.
@ref akn:art_29/p1 akn:art_30 akn:art_31 akn:art_33
`the agreement of 31.3.2020 prevails over an earlier arrangement` MEANS TRUE

-- §32: it is "another agreement" under the leave regulations for the
-- lecturers it covers, so the leave agreement of 18.3.2020 does not apply
-- to them.
@ref akn:art_32
GIVEN e IS A `college lecturer of 31.3.2020`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 31.3.2020 is another agreement for` e IF
    `the agreement of 31.3.2020 covers` e

-- akn:conclusions/p1 akn:conclusions/p2 akn:conclusions/t1 The signing formula and the signatures; no rule.

§§ `נספח א' — כתב הצטרפות`

-- Annex א': the form of the letter by which a college joins (§10(ב)),
-- addressed to the chief labour-relations officer; its blank date is this
-- agreement's (the corpus's note).
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 akn:att_1__hc_1/p5 akn:att_1__hc_1/p6 akn:att_1__hc_1/t1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p7 The form of the accession letter, whose effect §10(ב) encodes; no rule of its own.

§§ `Worked examples`

GIVEN `in the State's service` IS A BOOLEAN, `joined` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `college lecturer of 31.3.2020`
DECIDE `a college lecturer at 60%, of 31.3.2020` `in the State's service` `joined` IS
    `college lecturer of 31.3.2020` WITH
        `employed at a teacher-training college`              IS TRUE
        `on the teaching employees' scale, with their salary` IS TRUE
        `in the State's service`                              IS `in the State's service`
        `at a college that signed the accession letter`       IS `joined`
        `position at the college`                             IS 0.6
        `position elsewhere`                                  IS 0.4

#ASSERT `the agreement of 31.3.2020 covers` (`a college lecturer at 60%, of 31.3.2020` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `the agreement of 31.3.2020 covers` (`a college lecturer at 60%, of 31.3.2020` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement of 31.3.2020 covers` (`a college lecturer at 60%, of 31.3.2020` FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the position the agreement of 31.3.2020 governs` (`a college lecturer at 60%, of 31.3.2020` FALSE TRUE) EQUALS 0.6
#ASSERT `the consideration of 31.3.2020 after a reduction` 10000 0.25 EQUALS 7500
#ASSERT `pay for the deferred duties, of 31.3.2020` 2000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the agreement of 31.3.2020 is another agreement for` (`a college lecturer at 60%, of 31.3.2020` TRUE FALSE)
